<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>Jurvis</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>Jurvis</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>app.jurvis.pair</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>jurvis</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>JurvisWorkspaceRoot</key>
	<string>$(JURVIS_WORKSPACE_ROOT)</string>
	<key>LSApplicationCategoryType</key>
	<string>public.app-category.productivity</string>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsLocalNetworking</key>
		<true/>
	</dict>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>你在设置里打开「日历」后，Jurvis 读取近期的日程，只发送到你自己的 Mac，用来回答你的安排、避开冲突；它只新增，不改不删。</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsWriteOnlyAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Jurvis 替你订好位或安排好事情后，把它加进日历。</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>扫描 Mac 上的配对二维码。</string>
	<key>NSContactsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>你在设置里打开「通讯录」后，Jurvis 读取联系人的姓名、电话和邮箱，只发送到你自己的 Mac，用来按名字查号码和地址。</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>读取睡眠、运动、心率和经期记录，只发送到你自己的 Mac，用来回答你的健康问题。</string>
	<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Jurvis 不会向“健康”写入任何数据；它只读取你允许的记录。</string>
	<key>NSHighResolutionCapable</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>连接你的 Mac，使用本地助理、生图和短剧工具。</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>用语音向 Jurvis 提问，录音只发送到你自己的 Mac。</string>
	<key>NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>你在设置里打开「提醒事项」后，Jurvis 读取未完成的提醒并替你新增提醒，只发送到你自己的 Mac。</string>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations~ipad</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
